    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game type: Strategy role-playing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854140/extras/f0851aae954c8b22fb571931173d576b.avif?t=1739438024\" width=800 height=160 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--1.0 version, main phases includes: Herta Phase, Argenti Phase,  Beloberg Phase </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--1.0 version, side stories  include: Star Core Hunter, Ruan Mei, Eternal Fire Mansion, Pioneer Warrior, Grammer Iron Cavalry, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Large boss &amp; multi-phase boss  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--fog stage, escort stage, guard stage, racing stage, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854140/extras/361da634f9e8fa6c5f71fb759b04614a.poster.avif?t=1739438024\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854140/extras/361da634f9e8fa6c5f71fb759b04614a.webm?t=1739438024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854140/extras/361da634f9e8fa6c5f71fb759b04614a.mp4?t=1739438024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854140/extras/c6e4345523af7fd4eb5b946cca345ee9.avif?t=1739438024\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 characters playable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/